    "title": "Raleigh, Fox Homer in 13-3 Win at Appalachian State - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago Boone, N.C. – Walker Fox belted a three-run home run and a run-scoring double as part of a three-hit effort, plating four runs as Western Carolina thumped mountain-rival Appalachian State 13-3 on Tuesday night in the frontend of a nonconference home-and-home at Beaver Field at Jim and Bettie Smith Stadium. The two longtime rivals meet again in Cullowhee on Tues., April 14. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
